        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "During the Imperial Court contest supply camp, Fang Yuan holds a rank four East Window Gu again: pouring primeval essence makes it glimmer and pours an enormous amount of stored goods information into his mind. That stretch also recalls the earlier Lang Ya copy that held Eighty-Eight True Yang Building information.",
